        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Pacific Mozart Ensemble\n- People: Kurt Weill, Philip Glass, Meredith Monk, David Lang\n- Works: Der Lindberghflug\n- Events: 2002 chorus performance\n\nFacts:\n- Kurt Weill was a German composer who was born on March 2, 1900, and died on April 3, 1950.\n- Kurt Weill was active as a composer in Germany from the 1920s and in his later years in the United States.\n- In 2002, the Pacific Mozart Ensemble chorus performed Kurt Weill’s Der Lindberghflug.\n- In 2002, the Pacific Mozart Ensemble chorus performed works by Philip Glass, Meredith Monk, and David Lang alongside Der Lindberghflug, and this performance was described as a highlight.",
